mocktail-ui/build
# The Go binary embeds mocktail-api/build (go:embed). Ignore the generated assets but keep a
# committed .gitkeep so `go build`/`go test` compile even before the UI is built.
mocktail-api/build/*
!mocktail-api/build/.gitkeep
